<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Shard Volley</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Shard Volley</ansi> is used by the Spine Lattices of the Obelisk. The Lattice draws
its spines back, every point turning toward its target, then looses them
in quick succession: three shards, each a separate hit.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  The draw-back is your warning. A hard enough blow while its spines are
  drawn back can break the volley. After a volley the Lattice has to grow
  its spines again, and for a few rounds it can only fight up close.

